cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite the article and the data sources listed in data/sources.csv."
title: "Data, code and prompts for 'The cell biologist's guide to AI-assisted image analysis'"
abstract: "Data, code, figure builders and records of the LLM experiments (Claude Sonnet 5.5 via headless Claude Code) behind Figures 1-3 of 'The cell biologist's guide to AI-assisted image analysis'. Scripts rebuild the figures and recompute the reported scores from the stored data."
